Logical: KGIntervention
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: Intervention"
Description: "PICO I. The clinical or public-health action, distinct from health-intervention, which is the DAK-facing component. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/intervention."

* ^status = #active
* ^publisher = "World Health Organization (WHO)"
* description 0..1 string "Description" "PICO intervention, as described in the source."

Logical: KGComparator
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: Comparator"
Description: "PICO C. Frequently absent in WHO recommendations; absence is recorded rather than invented. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/comparator."

* ^status = #active
* ^publisher = "World Health Organization (WHO)"
* description 0..1 string "Description" "PICO comparator, as described in the source."

Logical: KGOutcome
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: Outcome"
Description: "PICO O. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/outcome."

