Logical: KGGraphDocument
Title: "Knowledge graph L1: graph document"
Description: "One L1 knowledge-graph document: typed nodes and reified edges, provenance-pinned to the sources it was extracted from. In JSON the context element is written @context."

* ^status = #active
* ^publisher = "World Health Organization (WHO)"
* context 1..1 uri "Context" "The JSON-LD context (written @context in JSON)."
* id 1..1 string "ID" "IRI of this graph document."
* type 1..1 code "Type" "Always Entity (prov:Entity)."
* ontologyVersion 1..1 string "Ontology version" "schemaVersion of the ontology this graph was built against."
* generatedAt 1..1 dateTime "Generated at" "When the document was generated."
* wasDerivedFrom 0..* KGProvenanceSource "Derived from" "The sources this graph was extracted from, each pinned by hash."
* nodes 0..* KGNode "Nodes" "The nodes."
* edges 0..* KGEdge "Edges" "The edges."
* dak 0..1 BackboneElement "DAK" "The DAK envelope: the fields of the DAK logical model."
